{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着人工智能計算需求持續增長，中國出現了將英偉達GeForce RTX 5090遊戲顯卡大規模改造為AI加速卡的生產線。根據Wccftech及其他硬件媒體援引的最新視頻資料，相關工廠正在拆解零售版RTX 5090顯卡，將GPU核心和顯存晶片轉移到專門設計的伺服器電路板上，再配備適合數據中心使用的散熱系統，使原本面向遊戲玩家的高端顯卡能夠用於AI計算。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583614.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:44:06.028148+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:20:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:38:13.293149+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:38:13.293149+00:00","content_hash":"92bfd352a7cebac8b894044420cdc4dfbfa81308371b30ced4dc7178a1e0012a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}